e same for direct packets. 0 to 2.␀␀␀␀Prefers stronger copies of a flood. 0 to 20.␀␀␀␀Minutes between zero-hop adverts: 0 (off) or 60 to 240.␀Hours between flood adverts: 0 (off) or 3 to 168.␀␀␀Lets a wrong or blank password in to read, not to post.␀Owner info␀␀Transmit power␀␀Repeat packets␀␀Flood hop limit␀Advert hop limit␀␀␀␀Loop detection␀␀Airtime factor␀␀Flood send delay␀␀␀␀Direct send delay␀␀␀Receive delay␀␀␀Local advert␀␀␀␀Flood advert␀␀␀␀Guest password␀␀Read-only access␀␀␀␀Node clock␀␀owner.info␀␀repeat␀␀flood.max␀␀␀flood.max.advert␀␀␀␀loop.detect␀off
